 r←Test_Busy_005(stopFlag batchFlag);n;i;⎕TRAP;parms;msg;noOfThreads
⍝ Exercise `Busy` with an "Abort" button. Checks the global-variable approach.
 r←∆Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 #.⎕SHADOW'TEMP'
 #.TEMP←#.⎕NS''

 noOfThreads←⍴⎕TNUMS

 parms←#._APLGUI.GUI.Busy.CreateParms
 parms.addToCaption←'This is "Busy" test no 5'
 parms.onTop←1
 parms.hasAbortButton←1

 msg←'This may take a moment'
 n←parms #._APLGUI.GUI.Busy.Create msg

 :For i :In 1+⍳10
     n #._APLGUI.GUI.Busy.SetPercent 10×i
     :If 5=i
         ⎕NQ n.AbortBtn'Select'
     :EndIf
     ⎕DL 1
     :If 0≠n.∆ABORTED
         :Leave
     :EndIf
 :EndFor

 n.∆CloseForm
 →GoToTidyUp noOfThreads≠⍴⎕TNUMS
 r←∆OK

∆TidyUp:
 :Trap 0 ⋄ #.TEMP.f.Close ⍬ ⋄ :EndTrap
